{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE21defaultLaunchBehavioryQrAA0dfG0VF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI13UtilityWindowV","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultLaunchBehavior"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19SceneLaunchBehaviorV","text":"SceneLaunchBehavior"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene"}],"extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","role":"symbol","title":"defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets the default launch behavior for this scene."}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow"]]},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow\/defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/utilitywindow\/defaultlaunchbehavior(_:)"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultLaunchBehavior","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"behavior"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SceneLaunchBehavior","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19SceneLaunchBehaviorV","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneLaunchBehavior"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This behavior can be used to define if a scene is shown on application"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"launch in the absence of any previously saved state."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On platforms that do not support multiple windows, this value is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On platforms other than Windows, there must be at least one scene that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presents itself. If no scenes are defined to present, the first scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will be presented, regardless of the value provided to this modifier."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"During app launch, on platforms other than Windows, the system","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"will only consider scenes whose role matches the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/bundleresources\/information_property_list\/uiapplicationpreferreddefaultscenesessionrole","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key in the application scene manifest of the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Info.plist","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" file.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For instance, a volumetric window would need the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIWindowSceneSessionRoleVolumetricApplication","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" role.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On Windows, this behavior will also be used to determine which scene is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presented when clicking on the icon of a running application with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"visible windows."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On visionOS, the system may background the last dismissed scene instead"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of closing it. Thus, the suppressed behavior additionally specifies that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the scene should not be presented when tapping on the application icon"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with no visible windows."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, you may wish to present a welcome window on launch of your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app when there are no previous document windows being restored:"}]},{"syntax":null,"code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        DocumentGroup(newDocument: MyDocument()) { configuration in","            DocumentEditor(configuration.$document)","        }","","        Window(\"Welcome to My App\", id: \"welcome\") {","            WelcomeView()","        }","        .defaultLaunchBehavior(.presented)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default value for all scenes if you do not apply this modifier is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneLaunchBehavior\/automatic"},{"type":"text","text":". With that strategy, a scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will only present itself if it is the first scene defined by the app,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and no other scenes have presented themselves."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Scene":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}],"title":"Scene","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scene","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A part of an app’s user interface with a life cycle managed by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"system.","type":"text"}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"title":"OpenSwiftUI","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/SceneLaunchBehavior":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SceneLaunchBehavior","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The launch behavior for a scene."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scenelaunchbehavior","title":"SceneLaunchBehavior","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SceneLaunchBehavior","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneLaunchBehavior"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/SceneLaunchBehavior/automatic":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The automatic behavior."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scenelaunchbehavior\/automatic","title":"automatic","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"automatic","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19SceneLaunchBehaviorV","text":"SceneLaunchBehavior","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneLaunchBehavior\/automatic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/UtilityWindow":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"UtilityWindow","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UtilityWindow","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A specialized window scene that provides secondary utility to the content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the main scenes of an application."}],"title":"UtilityWindow","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/utilitywindow","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/UtilityWindow/defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow\/defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultLaunchBehavior","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19SceneLaunchBehaviorV","text":"SceneLaunchBehavior","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets the default launch behavior for this scene."}],"title":"defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/utilitywindow\/defaultlaunchbehavior(_:)","kind":"symbol"}}}